    "acceptance": "CPU invariants only. GPU compile, visual, frame times and gameplay remain main-owned validation.",
    "tradeoffs": [
      "Procedural rounded stones use scanned surface textures; not scanned individual meshes.",
      "No shadow casts for tiny stones/shore grass; only 10 inaccessible outcrops cast shadows. Existing scene contact/AO provides near grounding.",
